## Known Issues

### Current Limitations

1. **Email Sending** - Requires external email service (SendGrid, SES, etc.)
2. **File Attachments** - Email attachments not yet supported
3. **Real-time Comments** - Comments require page refresh
4. **Version Diff** - Plain text diff only, no rich diff

### Workarounds

| Issue | Workaround |
|-------|------------|
| Comments not updating | Refresh the page manually |
| Large template preview | Use pagination in preview |
| Many tags slow loading | Limit to 100 tags per organization |

### Planned Fixes (v1.1)

- [ ] WebSocket for real-time comments
- [ ] Email attachment support
- [ ] Rich diff view for versions
- [ ] Bulk import/export templates

